OL,3,GNEWSABand records song that lasts less
OL,4,Athan a second
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Guernsey band believe their newly
OL,7,Freleased tune Don't let the fire go
OL,8,Fout, which is under a second long,
OL,9,Fcould be the shortest song in the
OL,10,Fworld.
OL,12,FCoastal Fire Department have made an
OL,13,Funofficial attempt to beat the world
OL,14,Frecord set by Napalm Deaths' You
OL,15,FSuffer, which was 1.316 seconds long.
OL,17,FBand member Ollie Goddard said he
OL,18,Fcontacted Guinness World Records and
OL,19,Fwas but told the category had been
OL,20,Fclosed after it had been "inundated by
OL,21,Frequests".
